1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:03,880
(Sheldon:)That's when Amy said,
"Want to make this interesting?"

2
00:00:04,844 --> 00:00:06,344
"Make this interesting"?

3
00:00:06,346 --> 00:00:07,946
(Penny:)You bet money on me?

4
00:00:07,948 --> 00:00:09,278
(Sheldon:)No, no.

5
00:00:09,282 --> 00:00:11,952
(Sheldon:)We designed an experiment
involving you.

6
00:00:11,952 --> 00:00:14,382
(Sheldon:)See? Now, isn't that
interesting?

7
00:00:14,387 --> 00:00:16,717
(Penny:)It's not interesting.

8
00:00:16,723 --> 00:00:18,593
(Penny:)It's incredibly insulting.

9
00:00:18,592 --> 00:00:20,922
Okay, (stammers)
maybe this will help--

10
00:00:20,927 --> 00:00:23,397
(Sheldon:)imagine you're holding a pen.

11
00:00:25,365 --> 00:00:27,865
(Sheldon:)Before you go too far,
not a special pen

12
00:00:27,867 --> 00:00:29,367
(Sheldon:)with your initials
engraved on it--

13
00:00:29,369 --> 00:00:30,939
(Sheldon:)that'll make the next part
really hard.

14
00:00:30,937 --> 00:00:31,937
(Sheldon:)Oh...

15
00:00:31,938 --> 00:00:32,938
(Penny:)That's it.

16
00:00:32,939 --> 00:00:33,939
Get out!

17
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,940
(Sheldon:)I don't understand
why you're mad at me.

18
00:00:35,942 --> 00:00:37,612
(Sheldon:)You should be mad
at Amy.

19
00:00:37,611 --> 00:00:39,581
(Sheldon:)Like I was
this afternoon.

20
00:00:39,579 --> 00:00:41,249
(Sheldon:)Hey, look at that--
I let it go.

21
00:00:41,247 --> 00:00:42,747
Get out!

22
00:00:45,385 --> 00:00:46,755
SHELDON:
Penny?
What?

23
00:00:46,753 --> 00:00:49,783
(Sheldon:)I think I left
my pen in there.

24
00:00:52,993 --> 00:00:54,993
(Bernadette:)I understand
why you're upset,

25
00:00:54,995 --> 00:00:57,465
(Bernadette:)but he worked really hard
to get the store ready.

26
00:00:57,464 --> 00:00:59,934
(Bernadette:)And it's just furniture.

